<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/fcsm-25-03/cl-06> a airkg:Claim ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:fcsm-25-03 ;
    airkg:about <https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/fcsm-25-03/co-api>,
