    airkg:term "open Government data asset" ;
    airkg:verbatim_text "the term ‘open Government data asset’ means a public data asset that is— (A) machine-readable; (B) available (or could be made available) in an open format; (C) not encumbered by restrictions, other than intellectual property rights, including under titles 17 and 35, that would impede the use or reuse of such asset; and (D) based on an underlying open standard that is maintained by a standards organization;" .

