    airkg:term "statistical purpose" ;
    airkg:verbatim_text "The term ‘statistical purpose’— (A) means the description, estimation, or analysis of the characteristics of groups, without identifying the individuals or organizations that comprise such groups; and (B) includes the development, implementation, or maintenance of methods, technical or administrative procedures, or information resources that support the purposes described in subparagraph (A)." .

