    airkg:term "Safety-Impacting AI" ;
    airkg:verbatim_text "The term “safety-impacting AI” refers to AI whose output produces an action or serves as a principal basis for a decision that has the potential to significantly impact the safety of: Human life or well-being; Climate or environment; Critical infrastructure; or Strategic assets or resources." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/m-24-10-advancing-governance-innovation-and-risk-management/d4> a airkg:Definition ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:m-24-10-advancing-governance-innovation-and-risk-management ;
    airkg:as_of_date "2024-03-28" ;
    airkg:grounding_span "The term “rights-impacting AI” refers to AI whose output serves as a" ;
    airkg:location "Section 6" ;
    airkg:normative_status "policy" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "da93e1a77eec432cba04708dacf09758" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.2" ;
    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "89e548f806c3e2c6702ab9996f92344b5c05ec0f26e0d4874ddb402449c044fb" ;
    airkg:term "Rights-Impacting AI" ;
    airkg:verbatim_text "The term “rights-impacting AI” refers to AI whose output serves as a principal basis for a decision or action concerning a specific individual or entity that has a legal, material, binding, or similarly significant effect on that individual’s or entity’s: civil rights, civil liberties, or privacy; equal opportunities; or access to critical government resources or services." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/m-24-10-advancing-governance-innovation-and-risk-management/d5> a airkg:Definition ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:m-24-10-advancing-governance-innovation-and-risk-management ;
