    airkg:term "derived product" ;
    airkg:verbatim_text "the term “derived product” means any asset created during the process of transforming a data asset (e.g., modifying or enriching through any contractor-performed cleaning, labeling, customization, etc.) for the purposes of training, testing, or validating a model, as well as any AI models, systems, or services developed using a data asset." .

