    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "22b59dff8504a1db8fa6e9c774c470549700ecbe2ae8f5d51dd2e8c215266baf" ;
    airkg:term "triple" ;
    airkg:verbatim_text "A component of an RDF graph including a subject, predicate, and object, which represents a node-arc-node segment of an RDF graph." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-json-ld-1-1-core/d2> a airkg:Definition ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:w3c-json-ld-1-1-core ;
    airkg:as_of_date "2020-07-16" ;
    airkg:grounding_span "A node in a graph that is neither an IRI, nor a literal. A blank node does not contain a de-referenceable identifier because it is either ephemeral in nature or does not contain information that needs to be linked to from outside of the linked data graph. In JSON-LD, a blank node is assigned an identifier starting with the prefix `_:`." ;
    airkg:location "§ 1.4 Terminology" ;
    airkg:normative_status "standard" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "3f500244d5f84ca2a4e16fe057ba2759" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.3" ;
    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "22b59dff8504a1db8fa6e9c774c470549700ecbe2ae8f5d51dd2e8c215266baf" ;
    airkg:term "blank node" ;
    airkg:verbatim_text "A node in a graph that is neither an IRI, nor a literal. A blank node does not contain a de-referenceable identifier because it is either ephemeral in nature or does not contain information that needs to be linked to from outside of the linked data graph. In JSON-LD, a blank node is assigned an identifier starting with the prefix `_:`." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-json-ld-1-1-core/d20> a airkg:Definition ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:w3c-json-ld-1-1-core ;
    airkg:as_of_date "2020-07-16" ;
    airkg:grounding_span "A context that is used to resolve terms while the processing algorithm is running." ;
    airkg:location "§ 1.4 Terminology" ;
    airkg:normative_status "standard" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "3f500244d5f84ca2a4e16fe057ba2759" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.3" ;
    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "22b59dff8504a1db8fa6e9c774c470549700ecbe2ae8f5d51dd2e8c215266baf" ;
    airkg:term "active context" ;
    airkg:verbatim_text "A context that is used to resolve terms while the processing algorithm is running." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-json-ld-1-1-core/d21> a airkg:Definition ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:w3c-json-ld-1-1-core ;
    airkg:as_of_date "2020-07-16" ;
    airkg:grounding_span "The base direction is the direction used when a string does not have a direction associated with it directly. It can be set in the context using the `@direction` key whose value must be one of the strings `\"ltr\"`, `\"rtl\"`, or `null`." ;
    airkg:location "§ 1.4 Terminology" ;
    airkg:normative_status "standard" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "3f500244d5f84ca2a4e16fe057ba2759" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.3" ;
    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "22b59dff8504a1db8fa6e9c774c470549700ecbe2ae8f5d51dd2e8c215266baf" ;
    airkg:term "base direction" ;
    airkg:verbatim_text "The base direction is the direction used when a string does not have a direction associated with it directly. It can be set in the context using the `@direction` key whose value must be one of the strings `\"ltr\"`, `\"rtl\"`, or `null`." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-json-ld-1-1-core/d22> a airkg:Definition ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:w3c-json-ld-1-1-core ;
    airkg:as_of_date "2020-07-16" ;
    airkg:grounding_span "A compact IRI has the form of prefix:*suffix* and is used as a way of expressing an IRI without needing to define separate term definitions for each IRI contained within a common vocabulary identified by prefix." ;
    airkg:location "§ 1.4 Terminology" ;
    airkg:normative_status "standard" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "3f500244d5f84ca2a4e16fe057ba2759" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.3" ;
    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "22b59dff8504a1db8fa6e9c774c470549700ecbe2ae8f5d51dd2e8c215266baf" ;
    airkg:term "compact IRI" ;
    airkg:verbatim_text "A compact IRI has the form of prefix:*suffix* and is used as a way of expressing an IRI without needing to define separate term definitions for each IRI contained within a common vocabulary identified by prefix." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-json-ld-1-1-core/d23> a airkg:Definition ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:w3c-json-ld-1-1-core ;
    airkg:as_of_date "2020-07-16" ;
    airkg:grounding_span "An expanded term definition is a term definition where the value is a map containing one or more keyword keys to define the associated IRI, if this is a reverse property, the type associated with string values, and a container mapping." ;
    airkg:location "§ 1.4 Terminology" ;
    airkg:normative_status "standard" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "3f500244d5f84ca2a4e16fe057ba2759" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.3" ;
    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "22b59dff8504a1db8fa6e9c774c470549700ecbe2ae8f5d51dd2e8c215266baf" ;
    airkg:term "expanded term definition" ;
    airkg:verbatim_text "An expanded term definition is a term definition where the value is a map containing one or more keyword keys to define the associated IRI, if this is a reverse property, the type associated with string values, and a container mapping." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-json-ld-1-1-core/d24> a airkg:Definition ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:w3c-json-ld-1-1-core ;
    airkg:as_of_date "2020-07-16" ;
    airkg:grounding_span "A JSON-LD document is a serialization of an RDF dataset." ;
    airkg:location "§ 1.4 Terminology" ;
    airkg:normative_status "standard" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "3f500244d5f84ca2a4e16fe057ba2759" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.3" ;
    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "22b59dff8504a1db8fa6e9c774c470549700ecbe2ae8f5d51dd2e8c215266baf" ;
    airkg:term "JSON-LD document" ;
    airkg:verbatim_text "A JSON-LD document is a serialization of an RDF dataset." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-json-ld-1-1-core/d25> a airkg:Definition ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:w3c-json-ld-1-1-core ;
    airkg:as_of_date "2020-07-16" ;
    airkg:grounding_span "The JSON-LD internal representation is the result of transforming a JSON syntactic structure into the core data structures suitable for direct processing: arrays, maps, strings, numbers, booleans, and null." ;
    airkg:location "§ 1.4 Terminology" ;
    airkg:normative_status "standard" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "3f500244d5f84ca2a4e16fe057ba2759" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.3" ;
    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "22b59dff8504a1db8fa6e9c774c470549700ecbe2ae8f5d51dd2e8c215266baf" ;
    airkg:term "JSON-LD internal representation" ;
    airkg:verbatim_text "The JSON-LD internal representation is the result of transforming a JSON syntactic structure into the core data structures suitable for direct processing: arrays, maps, strings, numbers, booleans, and null." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-json-ld-1-1-core/d26> a airkg:Definition ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:w3c-json-ld-1-1-core ;
    airkg:as_of_date "2020-07-16" ;
    airkg:grounding_span "A JSON-LD value is a string, a number, `true` or `false`, a typed value, or a language-tagged string. It represents an RDF literal." ;
    airkg:location "§ 1.4 Terminology" ;
    airkg:normative_status "standard" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "3f500244d5f84ca2a4e16fe057ba2759" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.3" ;
    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "22b59dff8504a1db8fa6e9c774c470549700ecbe2ae8f5d51dd2e8c215266baf" ;
    airkg:term "JSON-LD value" ;
    airkg:verbatim_text "A JSON-LD value is a string, a number, `true` or `false`, a typed value, or a language-tagged string. It represents an RDF literal." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-json-ld-1-1-core/d27> a airkg:Definition ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:w3c-json-ld-1-1-core ;
    airkg:as_of_date "2020-07-16" ;
    airkg:grounding_span "A node object represents zero or more properties of a node in the graph serialized by the JSON-LD document." ;
    airkg:location "§ 1.4 Terminology" ;
    airkg:normative_status "standard" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "3f500244d5f84ca2a4e16fe057ba2759" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.3" ;
    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "22b59dff8504a1db8fa6e9c774c470549700ecbe2ae8f5d51dd2e8c215266baf" ;
    airkg:term "node object" ;
    airkg:verbatim_text "A node object represents zero or more properties of a node in the graph serialized by the JSON-LD document." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-json-ld-1-1-core/d28> a airkg:Definition ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:w3c-json-ld-1-1-core ;
    airkg:as_of_date "2020-07-16" ;
    airkg:grounding_span "A prefix is the first component of a compact IRI which comes from a term that maps to a string that, when prepended to the suffix of the compact IRI, results in an IRI." ;
    airkg:location "§ 1.4 Terminology" ;
    airkg:normative_status "standard" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "3f500244d5f84ca2a4e16fe057ba2759" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.3" ;
    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "22b59dff8504a1db8fa6e9c774c470549700ecbe2ae8f5d51dd2e8c215266baf" ;
    airkg:term "prefix" ;
    airkg:verbatim_text "A prefix is the first component of a compact IRI which comes from a term that maps to a string that, when prepended to the suffix of the compact IRI, results in an IRI." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-json-ld-1-1-core/d29> a airkg:Definition ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:w3c-json-ld-1-1-core ;
    airkg:as_of_date "2020-07-16" ;
    airkg:grounding_span "The processing mode defines how a JSON-LD document is processed. By default, all documents are assumed to be conformant with this specification." ;
    airkg:location "§ 1.4 Terminology" ;
    airkg:normative_status "standard" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "3f500244d5f84ca2a4e16fe057ba2759" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.3" ;
    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "22b59dff8504a1db8fa6e9c774c470549700ecbe2ae8f5d51dd2e8c215266baf" ;
    airkg:term "processing mode" ;
    airkg:verbatim_text "The processing mode defines how a JSON-LD document is processed. By default, all documents are assumed to be conformant with this specification." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-json-ld-1-1-core/d3> a airkg:Definition ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:w3c-json-ld-1-1-core ;
    airkg:as_of_date "2020-07-16" ;
    airkg:grounding_span "A blank node identifier is a string that can be used as an identifier for a blank node within the scope of a JSON-LD document. Blank node identifiers begin with `_:`." ;
    airkg:location "§ 1.4 Terminology" ;
    airkg:normative_status "standard" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "3f500244d5f84ca2a4e16fe057ba2759" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.3" ;
