    airkg:grounding_span "Again we recommend use of the Dublin Core term `dct:publisher` for this. The organization should be represented as an instance of `foaf:Agent`, or some more specific subclass such as `org:Organization` [ORG]." ;
    airkg:location "9.2" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "abcd23228eb74c769f7b801abaad45f3" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.3" ;
    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "a04d0d72bb6af536756726914c54b9ce981703e5bb6defec762682f771d3e4c7" ;
    airkg:scope "dataset" ;
    airkg:text "Use dct:publisher and represent the publishing organization as a foaf:Agent or org:Organization." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-rdf-data-cube/p-dct-subject> a airkg:Practice ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:w3c-rdf-data-cube ;
    airkg:applies_to <https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-rdf-data-cube/c-dataset> ;
    airkg:as_of_date "2014-01-16" ;
    airkg:grounding_span "We encourage use of `dct:subject` to record such a classification of a whole data set." ;
    airkg:location "9.1" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "abcd23228eb74c769f7b801abaad45f3" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.3" ;
    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "a04d0d72bb6af536756726914c54b9ce981703e5bb6defec762682f771d3e4c7" ;
    airkg:scope "dataset" ;
    airkg:text "Use dct:subject to record a whole-dataset classification into statistical domains." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-rdf-data-cube/p-declare-code-class> a airkg:Practice ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:w3c-rdf-data-cube ;
    airkg:as_of_date "2014-01-16" ;
    airkg:grounding_span "It is convenient and good practice when developing a code list to also create a Class to denote all the codes within the code list, irrespective of hierarchical structure." ;
    airkg:location "8.1" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "abcd23228eb74c769f7b801abaad45f3" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.3" ;
    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "a04d0d72bb6af536756726914c54b9ce981703e5bb6defec762682f771d3e4c7" ;
    airkg:scope "dataset" ;
    airkg:text "When developing a code list also create a Class denoting all its codes so ranges can be checked by generic RDF tools." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-rdf-data-cube/p-hierarchical-skos-narrower> a airkg:Practice ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:w3c-rdf-data-cube ;
    airkg:applies_to <https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-rdf-data-cube/c-hierarchical-code-list> ;
    airkg:as_of_date "2014-01-16" ;
    airkg:grounding_span "Hierarchical code lists *SHOULD* be represented using the `skos:narrower` relationship, or a sub-property of it, to link from the `skos:hasTopConcept` codes down through the tree or lattice of child codes." ;
    airkg:location "8.2" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "abcd23228eb74c769f7b801abaad45f3" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.3" ;
    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "a04d0d72bb6af536756726914c54b9ce981703e5bb6defec762682f771d3e4c7" ;
    airkg:scope "dataset" ;
    airkg:text "Represent hierarchical code lists using skos:narrower or a sub-property of it." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-rdf-data-cube/p-http-uris> a airkg:Practice ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:w3c-rdf-data-cube ;
    airkg:as_of_date "2014-01-16" ;
    airkg:grounding_span "The approach [LOD] recommends use of HTTP URIs to name the entities and concepts so that consumers of the data can look-up those URIs to get more information, including links to other related URIs." ;
    airkg:location "2.1" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "abcd23228eb74c769f7b801abaad45f3" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.3" ;
    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "a04d0d72bb6af536756726914c54b9ce981703e5bb6defec762682f771d3e4c7" ;
    airkg:scope "content" ;
    airkg:text "Name entities and concepts with dereferenceable HTTP URIs so consumers can look them up." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-rdf-data-cube/p-normalized-preferred> a airkg:Practice ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:w3c-rdf-data-cube ;
    airkg:applies_to <https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-rdf-data-cube/c-normalized> ;
    airkg:as_of_date "2014-01-16" ;
    airkg:grounding_span "however normalized representations are in general easier to query and combine." ;
    airkg:location "6.4" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "abcd23228eb74c769f7b801abaad45f3" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.3" ;
    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "a04d0d72bb6af536756726914c54b9ce981703e5bb6defec762682f771d3e4c7" ;
    airkg:scope "dataset" ;
    airkg:text "Prefer normalized representations as they are generally easier to query and combine." .

<https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-rdf-data-cube/p-prefer-skos-over-hcl> a airkg:Practice ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:w3c-rdf-data-cube ;
    airkg:applies_to <https://brockwebb.github.io/ai-readiness-kg/doc/w3c-rdf-data-cube/c-hierarchical-code-list> ;
    airkg:as_of_date "2014-01-16" ;
    airkg:grounding_span "In the case where a code list is already available as a SKOS concept scheme or collection, or could reasonable me made so, then those *SHOULD* be used directly." ;
    airkg:location "8.3" ;
    airkg:prov_extraction_event_id "abcd23228eb74c769f7b801abaad45f3" ;
    airkg:prov_model_id "claude-opus-4-8" ;
    airkg:prov_schema_version "0.3" ;
    airkg:prov_source_sha256 "a04d0d72bb6af536756726914c54b9ce981703e5bb6defec762682f771d3e4c7" ;
    airkg:scope "dataset" ;
    airkg:text "Where a code list is already available as a SKOS concept scheme or collection, use SKOS directly rather than qb:HierarchicalCodeList." .

